  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Season the monkfish fillets with salt and black pepper.",
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of olive oil in the skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic; cook until the onion is translucent, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the monkfish fillets; cook for 2-3 minutes per side, or until browned.",
